---

This project orchestrates and bundles configuration for the following
third-party components, each distributed under its own license:

- LiteLLM            (https://github.com/BerriAI/litellm)         — MIT
- vLLM               (https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm)       — Apache-2.0
- Open WebUI         (https://github.com/open-webui/open-webui)   — see upstream
- Traefik            (https://github.com/traefik/traefik)         — MIT
- Prometheus         (https://github.com/prometheus/prometheus)   — Apache-2.0
- Grafana            (https://github.com/grafana/grafana)         — AGPL-3.0
- PostgreSQL         (https://www.postgresql.org/)                — PostgreSQL License
- Portainer CE       (https://github.com/portainer/portainer)     — zlib
- Langfuse Python    (https://github.com/langfuse/langfuse-python)— MIT

The Open WebUI plugin code under modules/webui/webui_functions/
(langfuse_integration.py and langfuse_v3_integration.py) is derived from
upstream Open WebUI examples and retains its MIT attribution headers.
